        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">Do you take small projects?</h3>
        <p>Sometimes. If it is genuinely small and well defined, yes. If it is small but vague, the assessment is usually the better starting point so we both know what we are looking at.</p>

        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">Can you take over a project someone else started?</h3>
        <p>Frequently. Inherited codebases and stalled projects are a real part of what I do. I will look at it first and give you an honest read on whether finishing it or restarting it is cheaper.</p>

        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">Do you work with agencies?</h3>
        <p>Yes, white-label. Umbraco migrations especially. You keep the client relationship and I do the work under your name.</p>

        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">What does it cost?</h3>
